    "title": "Headline: Second annual Porch Fest celebrates community - NewsBreak",
    "text": "thelumberjack.org\nwebsite\nArcata\nHeadline: Second annual Porch Fest celebrates community\nBy Web Editor,\n3 hours agoSunny Brae community comes together in a harmonious celebration of local music. The cozy little neighborhood of Sunny Brae is home to an eclectic group of residents. From families with young children to elderly folks who have lived in the area for decades to twenty-something-year-old college kids, Sunny Brae is a quiet and quaint sanctuary to many. But for one day out of the year, the community that many call home transforms into a lively music festival known as Porch Fest, complete with dozens of acts ranging from twangy folk numbers to electrifying punk.",
